# look straight through them to whoever last touched a line's behaviour.
#
# GitHub applies this file automatically. Locally it is opt-in, once per clone:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Add a revision here only if it is provably inert -- a formatter run, a
# whitespace sweep, a rename with no edits. A commit that changed one line of
# logic on the way past does not belong in this file.

